    "description": {
      "content": "Shared by the Deliveroo Partner Platform Suite and the Signature Suite. The Site API lets merchants govern fulfillment availability programmatically, including a site's open/close status, operating hours, days off, and workload mode. Authentication uses an OAuth 2.0 client credentials bearer token.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kin Lane\n Email: kin@apievangelist.com",
